# x442 prefix — DRAFT, not yet applied by the skill. Every text file is LF in the index and on
# checkout on every platform, so a Windows clone never converts to CRLF. Keep it ABOVE the upstream
# template: a later line overrides an earlier one, so placed after it, `* text=auto` would undo
# upstream's `-text` on the LFS binaries and its explicit `text` on *.cs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe mis-parses a batch file stored with LF
*.bat text eol=crlf

